ESP32 HTTP Endpoints
Root
/

Displays the current SmartPin status.

GPS
/gps

Returns the latest GPS information.

Receive GPS
/location?lat=<latitude>&lon=<longitude>

Receives GPS coordinates from the smartphone.

Complete System Information
/info

Returns:

ESP32 IP
Student ID
Student name
Classroom
GPS status
SOS status
